> [!NOTE]
> **Scientific Interpretation of Attention Weights**:
> The learned attention coefficients represent the model's learned allocation of representation importance among physically adjacent neighbors and self-state. They reflect model-estimated relevance during spatial message aggregation, and do **not** constitute proof of causal influence in physical traffic dynamics.

